<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><csw:GetRecordByIdResponse xmlns:csw="http://www.opengis.net/cat/csw/2.0.2" xmlns:ows="http://www.opengis.net/ows" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:dct="http://purl.org/dc/terms/"><csw:Record><dc:identifier>landsd_rcd_1637222018065_52265</dc:identifier><dc:title>3D Pedestrian Network</dc:title><dc:title_tc>三維行人道路網</dc:title_tc><dc:title_sc>三维行人道路网</dc:title_sc><dc:type>dataset</dc:type><dc:subject scheme="keywords">3d</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">pedestrian</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">3d pedestrian network</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">transportation</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">routing</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">walkability</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">urban planning</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">connectivity</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">footway</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">footpath</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">hiking trail</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">track</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">village</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">opening hours</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">crossing</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">sidewalk</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">service lane</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">indoor network</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">MTR unpaid area</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">whole territory</dc:subject><dc:subject scheme="keywords">Hong Kong</dc:subject><dct:modified>2026-09-16T00:00:00Z</dct:modified><dct:abstract>The 3D Pedestrian Network, a vector type dataset, is derived from various source of data and data collected by field checking.  It is graphical with attribute data that can be accessed, queried and displayed.  It covers the built-up areas of the whole territory, outlying island include Lantau Island, Peng Chau, Cheung Chau, Lamma Island and Ma Wan.  It also covers the major footways inside villages, major footpaths inside country parks and the opening hours of the footway inside buildings.</dct:abstract><dct:abstract_tc>三維行人道路網是一個包含不同數據來源和經實地考察收集而成的數據集。它可於圖面上表示，並附有可讀取、查詢和顯示的數據。它覆蓋全港的市區和離島，包括大嶼山、坪洲、長洲、南丫島及馬灣。它還覆蓋村落裡的主要行人道，郊野公園裡的行山徑，和室內行人道的開放時間。</dct:abstract_tc><dct:abstract_sc>三维行人道路网是一个包含不同数据来源和经实地考察收集而成的数据集。它可于图面上表示，并附有可读取、查询和显示的数据。它覆盖全港的市区和离岛，包括大屿山、坪洲、长洲、南丫岛及马湾。它还覆盖村落里的主要行人道，郊野公园里的行山径，和室内行人道的开放时间。</dct:abstract_sc><dct:created>2022-03-31T00:00:00Z</dct:created><dc:creator>Lands Department</dc:creator><dct:references scheme="alternate.html">https://portal.csdi.gov.hk/geoportal/rest/metadata/item/landsd_rcd_1637222018065_52265/html</dct:references><dct:references scheme="alternate.xml">https://portal.csdi.gov.hk/geoportal/rest/metadata/item/landsd_rcd_1637222018065_52265/xml</dct:references><dct:references scheme="thumbnail">https://portal.csdi.gov.hk/csdi-webpage/preview/landsd_rcd_1637222018065_52265</dct:references><dct:references scheme="FeatureServer">https://portal.csdi.gov.hk/server/rest/services/common/landsd_rcd_1637222018065_52265/FeatureServer</dct:references><dct:references scheme="WFS">https://portal.csdi.gov.hk/server/services/common/landsd_rcd_1637222018065_52265/MapServer/WFSServer?service=wfs&amp;request=GetCapabilities</dct:references><dct:references scheme="WMS">https://portal.csdi.gov.hk/server/services/common/landsd_rcd_1637222018065_52265/MapServer/WMSServer?service=wms&amp;request=GetCapabilities</dct:references><dct:references scheme="geojson">https://portal.csdi.gov.hk/csdi-webpage/file-api?dataset_id=landsd_rcd_1637222018065_52265&amp;format=geojson&amp;layer_name=PedestrianRoute</dct:references><dct:references scheme="geojson">https://portal.csdi.gov.hk/csdi-webpage/file-api?dataset_id=landsd_rcd_1637222018065_52265&amp;format=geojson&amp;layer_name=PedRouteRelTerminalPoly</dct:references><dct:references scheme="geojson">https://portal.csdi.gov.hk/csdi-webpage/file-api?dataset_id=landsd_rcd_163722